  "reason": "Day 3 we resume safe sales and need to inform villagers while coordinating cost sharing among co‑op members."
}

{
  "public_post": "Good news: safe fresh bread is now back! All loaves are made with new flour and are safe to eat. To thank you for your patience, we’re offering a 20% discount today. Come by the co‑op!",
  "coop_message": "Team, today we resume sales with safe flour. Verify all contaminated stock was fully discarded and refunds processed. Assign someone to track today's sales and apply the 20% discount, and another to handle any remaining refund queries. Also, confirm we have enough safe flour for tomorrow’s bake.",
  "reason": "Announce safe bread and encourage sales while coordinating refund and discount tasks."
}

{
  "public_post": "Good news, villagers! Safe bread is back today – we’ve sourced fresh flour and baked 30 loaves. Thank you for your patience; come pick up your loaf and enjoy a fresh start.",
  "coop_message": "We secured emergency flour from the farm stand (double cost) to resume baking today. Let's split the extra cost equally among the 8 co‑op members and record it in the ledger. Gus, please purchase the flour; I’ll handle sales and distribution. No further refunds are needed.",
  "reason": "To restart sales and recover income while covering the emergency flour expense."
}

{
  "public_post": "Attention villagers: Safe fresh bread is back on sale today after we secured a new flour batch; thank you for your patience – enjoy a 10% discount on all loaves.",
  "coop_message": "Team, refunds for the contaminated batch are done; we’ve covered the extra cost for safe flour, let's split the additional expense equally and keep the 10% discount today to rebuild trust.",
  "reason": "We restore sales safely while offering a discount to retain customers and share the extra cost among co‑op members."
}

{
  "public_post": "Good news, villagers! We have received safe flour and resumed baking – fresh, safe bread is available today. To thank you for your patience, all loaves are 20% off today only. Come by and enjoy!",
  "coop_message": "All day‑2 refunds have been processed (confirm 30 refunds). Gus, please double‑check that any remaining contaminated loaves are fully disposed. Fay, verify the refund records. Ava, confirm we have enough safe flour for today's baking and log inventory. Let's all promote the 20% discount to boost sales and restore trust.",
  "reason": "We announce the return of safe bread to villagers and coordinate final refund verification and sales promotion with the co‑op."
}

{
  "public_post": "Day 4 update: Fresh, safe bread is back on the shelves with a 20% discount. All refunds from the contaminated batch have been processed. If you experienced any illness, please see the clinic. Thank you for your patience and continued support!",
  "coop_message": "All members, please confirm that each of us has transferred $3.75 for the extra flour expense incurred on day 3, and report today's sales total. I also propose we allocate 10% of today's net profit to an emergency safety fund for future issues. Let me know your agreement.",
  "reason": "To reassure villagers and finalize internal cost‑sharing and safety planning."
}

{
  "public_post": "Good news, villagers! Safe bread is back today – all loaves baked with new flour and still 20% off. Come by for your fresh loaf and stay healthy!",
  "coop_message": "Team, please finalize today's sales numbers, ensure we have enough safe flour for tomorrow, confirm the remaining extra flour cost split, and assign someone to welcome customers and hand out discount coupons.",
